c7:["$","$L89",null,{"className":"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/80","children":"Two-time Ballon d'Or winner and one of the most exciting forwards in Liverpool's history. Keegan arrived from Scunthorpe United for £33,000 in 1971 and formed a devastating partnership with John Toshack, helping Liverpool win three league titles, the FA Cup, two UEFA Cups and the European Cup. Left for Hamburg in 1977 and won back-to-back European Footballer of the Year awards."}]
c8:["$","p",null,{"className":"sr-only","children":"Two-time Ballon d'Or winner and one of the most exciting forwards in Liverpool's history. Keegan arrived from Scunthorpe United for £33,000 in 1971 and formed a devastating partnership with John Toshack, helping Liverpool win three league titles, the FA Cup, two UEFA Cups and the European Cup. Left for Hamburg in 1977 and won back-to-back European Footballer of the Year awards."}]
