ca:["$","$L89",null,{"className":"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/80","children":"Liverpool's captain during their most glorious modern era. Henderson lifted the Champions League, Premier League, FA Cup, League Cup and FIFA Club World Cup as skipper, becoming the first Liverpool captain to raise the league title in 30 years. His infectious leadership and relentless dedication over 12 years made him one of the most important players in the club's history."}]
